---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="About" description="About Arjun and why this site exists">
  <section class="about">
    <h1>About</h1>

    <div class="prose">
      <h2>Hi, I'm Arjun</h2>
      <p>
        <!-- Add your bio here -->
        I like to build solutions to problems I find interesting.
      </p>

      <h2>Why I built this</h2>
      <p>
        <!-- Add your motivation here -->
        I've been reading a lot about the benefits of being able to write out your own thoughts, and I sure have a lot of them. I wanted a place where I could do that without feeling the need to cater to an audience or worry about engagement. 
        I also want to be able to look back on my progress and see how my thinking has evolved over time. 
      </p>
      <p>
        Many of these posts are written with a combination of <a href="https://wisprflow.ai/">Wispr Flow</a> and writing, so the tone may be a bit weird.
        I also expect to have a lot of half-baked ideas and thoughts that I never fully flesh out, and that's okay.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .about h1 {
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
  }
</style>
